  "body": "I'm in the process of implementing an XML processing library and I see the CDataSection and Node.CDATA_SECTION_NODE is being removed. What is the rationale for that decision?\n\nI do not see any other way of determining that an XML node is CDATA. I need to know whether a node is plain text or CDATA to handle it correctly.\n",
